        "text_grrNqr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’re looking for a full-time Warehouse, Logistics & Packaging person to join us in Rupià from January 2027. You’ll look after our beer from the moment it’s packaged until it reaches the customer: cold storage, stock, packaging support, orders and deliveries. If you’re organised, hands-on, hold a B licence and love beer, we’d like to hear from you.</p>",
